{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67e67779c728bf81f0f95a","object":"chat.completion","created":1785194103,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to embody \"nothing\" - to be nothing itself. This is an interesting philosophical/creative prompt. How would \"nothing\" express itself?\n\nNothing is absence. Nothing doesn't speak. Nothing has no voice, no words, no expression.\n\nThe challenge: how do I output \"only what the concept itself would say or express\" when the concept is nothing? Nothing wouldn't say anything. Nothing is the absence of saying.\n\nOptions:\n1. Output literally nothing (empty response"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}